[Mission.Objectives]
Destroy the enemy defenses.
[Mission.Description]
German troops have taken up yet another defensive line. They have concentrated significant antitank forces near Chismena.

Your order is to:
- Destroy the enemy defenses in the area of Chismena.
[Mission.Success]
The enemy defenses were destroyed. Your task has been a success!
[Mission.Failed]
You failed to fulfill your order!
[Submission_1.Objectives]
Capture the heights.
[Submission_1.Description]
The enemy forces are concentrated on the heights to the north of the settlement. The defending enemy forces include antitank guns and self-propelled guns. 

Your order is to:
- Drive the enemy away from the heights.
[Submission_1.Success]
Your task has been fulfilled! You drove the enemy away from the heights.
[Submission_1.Failed]
The enemy has repelled your attack. You failed to fulfill your order!